        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TOO MANY BOTS</strong> is a first-person action arcade built on a relentless hunt-or-be-hunted loop, a twisted test of survival inside retro-styled mazes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each run, choose a map and enter the experiment. Rules twist, roles flip, and the bots never stop. You’re prey one moment, hunter the next, caught in an endless cycle where adaptation is your only weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every completed run increases the game difficulty, so mastering the mechanics is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/0ee1620f6080f750112ea2261c981fdc.poster.avif?t=1781818479\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/0ee1620f6080f750112ea2261c981fdc.webm?t=1781818479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/0ee1620f6080f750112ea2261c981fdc.mp4?t=1781818479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure skill challenge with no metaprogression, only your ability to adapt and improve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new game modes, each with unique rules and objectives that rewrite how you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycle endlessly between prey and hunter as the power balance shifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore retro-PS1 maps, each with its own atmosphere and hidden pulse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive endless swarms of bots, always there, always looming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect temporary power-ups to boost your survival just a little longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run ramps up the difficulty, pushing your reflexes to the limit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/e47d22e9ce3ed67781f4e59dcc7e9bee.poster.avif?t=1781818479\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/e47d22e9ce3ed67781f4e59dcc7e9bee.webm?t=1781818479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/e47d22e9ce3ed67781f4e59dcc7e9bee.mp4?t=1781818479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Too Many Bots</strong>, you're on your own. Every mode is a puzzle where you must find the winning strategy under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt. Survive. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TOO MANY BOTS</strong> is a first-person action arcade built on a relentless hunt-or-be-hunted loop, a twisted test of survival inside retro-styled mazes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each run, choose a map and enter the experiment. Rules twist, roles flip, and the bots never stop. You’re prey one moment, hunter the next, caught in an endless cycle where adaptation is your only weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every completed run increases the game difficulty, so mastering the mechanics is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/0ee1620f6080f750112ea2261c981fdc.poster.avif?t=1781818479\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/0ee1620f6080f750112ea2261c981fdc.webm?t=1781818479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/0ee1620f6080f750112ea2261c981fdc.mp4?t=1781818479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure skill challenge with no metaprogression, only your ability to adapt and improve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new game modes, each with unique rules and objectives that rewrite how you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycle endlessly between prey and hunter as the power balance shifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore retro-PS1 maps, each with its own atmosphere and hidden pulse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive endless swarms of bots, always there, always looming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect temporary power-ups to boost your survival just a little longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run ramps up the difficulty, pushing your reflexes to the limit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/e47d22e9ce3ed67781f4e59dcc7e9bee.poster.avif?t=1781818479\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/e47d22e9ce3ed67781f4e59dcc7e9bee.webm?t=1781818479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015860/extras/e47d22e9ce3ed67781f4e59dcc7e9bee.mp4?t=1781818479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Too Many Bots</strong>, you're on your own. Every mode is a puzzle where you must find the winning strategy under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt. Survive. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
